# ❌ 5. ISSUE 1: POSTGRES POD PENDING

## ❌ Problem

```
PVC Pending → No StorageClass
```

## ✅ Fix

Installed Local Path Provisioner:

```
kubectl apply -f https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rancher/local-path-provisioner/master/deploy/local-path-storage.yaml
```

Set default:

```
kubectl patch storageclass local-path \
-p '{"metadata": {"annotations":{"storageclass.kubernetes.io/is-default-class":"true"}}}'
```

Restarted:

```
kubectl delete pvc --all -n ecommerce
kubectl delete pod postgres-0 -n ecommerce
```

## ✅ Result

* Postgres Running ✅

---

# ❌ 6. ISSUE 2: INGRESS NOT WORKING

## ❌ Problem

```
LoadBalancer EXTERNAL-IP = <pending>
```

## 🔍 Root Cause

* Using kubeadm (NOT cloud-managed cluster)
* No real LoadBalancer support

## ✅ Fix

Changed service type:

```
kubectl patch svc ingress-nginx-controller \
-n ingress-nginx \
-p '{"spec": {"type": "NodePort"}}'
```

## ✅ Verified:

```
kubectl get svc -n ingress-nginx
```

Got:

```
80:32359
```

